  "Codex is on this computer but not logged in. To have pictures:\n1. Open a terminal: on Windows, Start, then type Terminal.\n2. Paste `codex login` and sign in with your ChatGPT account in the browser that opens.\nCodex makes them with your ChatGPT plan, never paying by the picture.": "这台电脑上已安装 Codex，但尚未登录。要使用图片：\n1. 打开终端：在 Windows 中点击开始，然后输入“终端”。\n2. 粘贴 `codex login`，并在弹出的浏览器中登录你的 ChatGPT 账号。\nCodex 使用你的 ChatGPT 套餐生成图片，无需按张付费。",
